      "panel_id": "p04_mars_landing",
      "start_s": 0.0,
      "end_s": 6.45,
      "text": "Mars. Mika’s ship touched down at the spaceport of the Central Artificial Intelligence Data Center."
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH01_P04_L002",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "panel_id": "p04_mika_walk",
      "start_s": 6.92,
      "end_s": 10.37,
      "text": "The Red Planet welcomed Mika with a swirling sandstorm!"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH01_P04_L003",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "panel_id": "p04_reception",
      "start_s": 10.9,
      "end_s": 13.43,
      "text": "Excuse me… May I see the AI?"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH01_P04_L004",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_012",
      "panel_id": "p04_reception",
      "start_s": 13.84,
      "end_s": 16.93,
      "text": "Of course! But first… a few forms."
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH01_P04_L005",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "panel_id": "p04_elevator",
      "start_s": 17.21,
      "end_s": 24.83,
      "text": "Even in the future, paperwork never goes away! Forms done, Mika took a long elevator ride down."
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH01_P04_L006",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "panel_id": "p04_ai_core",
      "start_s": 25.24,
      "end_s": 31.04,
      "text": "Deep inside Mars lay an enormous hall. A bridge led to a glowing orb…"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH01_P04_L007",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_013",
      "panel_id": "p04_mika_orb_close",
      "start_s": 31.67,
      "end_s": 32.3,
      "text": "Mika…"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH01_P04_L008",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "panel_id": "p04_mika_orb_close",
      "start_s": 32.97,
      "end_s": 34.7,
      "text": "You… know my name?!"
    }
  ]
